  "description": "The enterprise companion to Blazor-ApexGrid: an ApexGridEnterprise component for apex-grid-enterprise with row grouping, aggregations, pivoting, a grand-total row, cell range selection, a context menu and XLSX export. The enterprise bundle ships inside the package and reuses the apex-grid core from Blazor-ApexGrid. A commercial product: a Premium license or higher is required, and without a license key the grid renders a trial watermark.",
