  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "0.1.0 First release. Bundles apex-grid-enterprise 0.10.0 and reuses the apex-grid 5.0.0 core and Lit from Blazor-ApexGrid 1.3.0, so a page with both packages holds one core. ApexGridEnterprise<TItem> extends ApexGrid<TItem> with GroupBy and GroupingOptions, Aggregations, TotalRow, Pivot, RangeSelection, ContextMenu (custom items raise OnContextMenuItemClick) and XLSX export, plus OnRangeChanged and OnGroupExpanded. The license key and the feature modules are set once with AddApexGridEnterprise or ApexGridEnterprise.SetLicense. Not yet modelled: the server-side and infinite row models, master/detail, formulas, integrated charts, the AI toolkit and the six companion elements.",
